# FlintTrade — automation

> Cron scheduler, Telegram bot, OpenClaw agent bridge, post-market analysis

## Absorbs
- OpenClaw (external service; local-dev clone at `.local/external/openclaw/` via `scripts/setup-test-deps.sh`) → AI agent gateway, Telegram/WhatsApp/Discord, heartbeats, skills

## Depends on: core, engine, ai, data

## Rules
- Read root CLAUDE.md for project-wide rules
- Use packages/core/core/src/openalgo_client.py for ALL OpenAlgo API calls
- Never reference specific brokers
- Tests are in the `tests/` directory. Add new test files as needed.
- Update root CHANGELOG.md
- Branch: main (pre-release, all commits to main)

## Broker authentication
- Broker login (OAuth, PIN, and session management) is handled by OpenAlgo, NOT FlintTrade
- FlintTrade connects to OpenAlgo via API key only
- If the OpenAlgo session expires, the dashboard notifies the user to
  re-authenticate at the OpenAlgo web interface
